sisCode '= \"\") set record.DiagnosisCode = diagnosisCode","        if (diagnosisName '= \"\") set record.DiagnosisName = diagnosisName","        if (mainOperationCode '= \"\") set record.MainOperationCode = mainOperationCode","        if (mainOperationName '= \"\") set record.MainOperationName = mainOperationName","        if (department '= \"\") set record.Department = department","        if (departmentDesc '= \"\") set record.DepartmentDesc = departmentDesc","        ","        // 8. 设置DRG分组结果（核心字段）","        set record.DRG = drg","        set record.DRGDesc = drgDesc","        set record.CCFlag = ccFlag","        set record.MCCFlag = mccFlag        ","        ","        // 数值型字段转换","        if (weight '= \"\") set record.Weight = +weight","        if (benchmarkCost '= \"\") set record.BenchmarkCost = +benchmarkCost","        ","        // 分组时间解析","        if (groupTime '= \"\")","        {","            try {","                set record.GroupTime = $ZDATETIMEH(groupTime, 3)","            } catch {","                // 如果时间格式不正确，使用当前时间","                set record.GroupTime = $ZDATETIME($HOROLOG, 3)","            }","        }","        else","        {","            set record.GroupTime = $ZDATETIME($HOROLOG, 3)","        }","        ","        // 9. 设置机构信息","        if (fixmedinsCode '= \"\") set record.FixmedinsCode = fixmedinsCode","        if (fixmedinsName '= \"\") set record.FixmedinsName = fixmedinsName","        ","        // 10. 设置分组阶段和备注","        if (groupStage '= \"\") set record.GroupStage = groupStage","        if (remark '= \"\") set record.Remark = remark","        ","        // 11. 设置就诊时间信息（入院时间、出院时间、结算时间）","        if (admDateTime '= \"\")","        {","            try {","                set record.AdmDateTime = $ZDATETIMEH(admDateTime, 3)","            } catch {","                set record.AdmDateTime = admDateTime","            }","        }","        if (discgDateTime '= \"\")","        {","            try {","                set record.DiscgDateTime = $ZDATETIMEH(discgDateTime, 3)","            } catch {","                set record.DiscgDateTime = discgDateTime","            }","        }","        if (settleDateTime '= \"\")","        {","            try {","                set record.SettleDateTime = $ZDATETIMEH(settleDateTime, 3)","            } catch {","                set record.SettleDateTime = settleDateTime","            }","        }","        ","        // 11. 查询DRG指向（HB_DRGCoreAlgorithmData表），按年份优先匹配","        if (drg '= \"\")&&(mdtrtareaAreaCode '=\"\")&&(fixmedinsCode '=\"\")","        {","            set drgDr = \"\"","            //先查当前年份","            &sql(SELECT ID INTO :drgDr FROM HB_DRGCoreAlgorithmData WHERE DRG = :drg and FixmedinsCode=:fixmedinsCode and MdtrtArea=:mdtrtareaAreaCode AND (Year=:groupYear OR Year IS NULL OR Year=''))","            if (drgDr = \"\") {","                //回退查上一年","                set prevYear = groupYear - 1","                &sql(SELECT ID INTO :drgDr FROM HB_DRGCoreAlgorithmData WHERE DRG = :drg and FixmedinsCode=:fixmedinsCode and MdtrtArea=:mdtrtareaAreaCode AND (Year=:prevYear OR Year IS NULL OR Year=''))","            }","            if (drgDr = \"\") {","                //最后不过滤年份","                &sql(SELECT ID INTO :drgDr FROM HB_DRGCoreAlgorithmData WHERE DRG = :drg and FixmedinsCode=:fixmedinsCode and MdtrtArea=:mdtrtareaAreaCode)","            }","            if (drgDr '= \"\") set record.DRGDr = drgDr","        }","        ","        // 10. 获取当前用户信息（从session）","        if ($DATA(jsonObj.session) && (jsonObj.session.%Size() > 0))","        {","            set session = jsonObj.session.%Get(0)","            if (isNew && (session.userId '= \"\"))","            {","                set record.CreateUserDr = session.userId","            }","            elseif (session.userId '= \"\")","            {","                set record.UpdateUserDr = session.userId","            }                       ","        }","        ","        // 12. 保存记